  "note": "BH-8390 R-CAT. worker-node-lanes-build / worker-node-catalog-compose R0 'real tree has offenders', and this member adds or edits the suite that loads the worker without the worker_catalogs helper. Fix round: the two helper lines after DIR=. Hand fixes #8089 #8300."
